# To the Primeval Isle (Q110): a level 75 character accepts at Anton, who gives the ancient book,
# and brings it to Marquez, who pays adena; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q110_to_the_primeval_isle.golden
character Courier 75
script quest.Q110_ToThePrimevalIsle
item 8777 57
page merchant/31338.htm
page default/32113.htm
page script/quest/Q110_ToThePrimevalIsle/
npc anton 31338 Merchant 10 0 0
npc marquez 32113 Folk 20 0 0

# Anton: three pages, then accept.
action anton
action anton
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=anton item=0 page=merchant/31338.htm
